                                "sense_id": "36610789-da95-3a09-8f09-dc7f1fa1d41a",
                                "text": "Thus haue I deſcribed and opened as by a kinde of diſſection, thoſe peccant humors (the principall of them) vvhich hath not onely giuen impediment to the proficence of Learning, but haue giuen alſo occaſion, to the traducement thereof: […]"
