                                "sense_id": "36610789-da95-3a09-8f09-dc7f1fa1d41a",
                                "text": "Rome muſt knovv / The value of her ovvn: 'tvvere a concealment / VVorſe than a theft, no leſs than a traducement, / To hide your doings; and to ſilence that, / VVhich, to the ſpire and top of praiſes vouch'd, / VVould ſeem but modeſt..."
